EntityDescription,A floating restorative totem summoned by Juggernaut that heals nearby allies for a percentage of their maximum HP each turn.,
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",
EntityName,healing ward,
EntityName,waterkin,
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,
ItemName,tidal orb,
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 2 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 2 turns after taking damage.,
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% to 35% chance (by Medium Blade mastery) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.",
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.",
PropertyName,blade dance,
PropertyName,blade fury,
PropertyName,bladeform,
PropertyName,ebb and flow,
RaceName,waterkin//female,
RaceName,waterkin//male,
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin in a bladestorm for 4 to 6 turns, gaining debuff immunity, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage to adjacent foes each turn (can crit with Blade Dance).",
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.",
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance critical strikes and Bladeform bonuses.",
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 8 to 16 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 4% to 8% of their maximum HP each turn.",
